  "comparison": "Six paired comparisons: two models by three events. Same evidence and model within each pair; full existing harness stage allowances, with direct output ceiling equal to maximum aggregate harness output (2200 contract + 8192 draft + 3000 review + 5000 correction + 3000 second review). This matches a ceiling, not realized tokens, latency or cost. No web research, prompt adaptation or rerunning failed rows.",
